# Regenerate: vhs docs/vhs/demo-overview.tape
# Requires: devcompass linked globally (`npm link` from the repo root)

Output docs/assets/demo-overview.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1160
Set Height 620
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms
Set Padding 20
Set Margin 0

Hide
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "devcompass --help"
Enter
Sleep 5s
